<p><strong>Gallery with circular tiles</strong><br />

<a href="http://wpwindowsphone.wordpress.com/2013/02/28/version-2-0/attachment/02/" title="Fire Hydrant"><img /></a>
<a href="http://wpwindowsphone.wordpress.com/2013/02/28/version-2-0/attachment/03/" title="Pier"><img /></a>
